            <note corresp="#d291-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d291-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 751G.5–MSP/12–3155. Secret; Priority;
                    limit Distribution. Drafted by Kattenburg; cleared with Hoey, Young, Sebald, Tyler, Phleger, MacArthur,
                    and Murphy; and cleared for transmission
                    by Robertson. Repeated for information to
                    Paris and London.</p>
            </note>
